{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0Rvb3IlMjBUbyUyMERvb3IlMjAlMjgyMDAyJTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Door To Door","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/cXrWdI2rUVqhy6E7w6025ldpFxd.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/srOjpYje1x22Nzo7mAoqmQO8jzb.jpg","description":"Sometimes the true heroes in our lives are those people who inspire us not with their superhuman accomplishments but simply by their refusal to give up in the face of seemingly insurmountable odds and the dignity in which they go about their lives. Bill Porter is one of those heroes. Born with cerebral palsy, he was told for many years that he was unemployable. But with the unwavering support of a dedicated mother and an indomitable spirit that has become his trademark, Porter did support himself as a door-to-door salesman in Portland, Oregon.","releaseInfo":"2002","genres":["TV Movie","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"90 min","cast":["William H. Macy","Kyra Sedgwick","Kathy Baker","Joel Brooks","Woody Jeffreys","Helen Mirren","Romy Rosemont","Troy Yorke"],"director":["Steven Schachter"],"released":"2002-07-14T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"William H. Macy","character":"Bill Porter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/hdVEGSrP8qWlJnt0v5vSVcGOjy7.jpg"},{"name":"Kyra Sedgwick","character":"Shelly Soomky Brady","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cfpLVZWChElvkKegZopC0xDjEWk.jpg"},{"name":"Kathy Baker","character":"Gladys Sullivan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/34zuI0qWTD5jdqmJRtPwaW70JcQ.jpg"},{"name":"Joel Brooks","character":"Alan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/202IdzSEDlz3dlqFEWKQvAarCmc.jpg"},{"name":"Woody Jeffreys","character":"Brad","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4b46XL5FldjSWlb9REaz0W16Xv0.jpg"},{"name":"Helen Mirren","character":"Mrs. Porter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1reKRrsdsHXJaRVHVyOEg4oPTcZ.jpg"},{"name":"Romy Rosemont","character